---
title: "calculate_multiplication_complexity (EIP-7883: ModExp Gas Cost Increase)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_compute_max: max_length = max(base_length, modulus_length)
    q_compute_max --> q_compute_words: words = ceil(max_length / 8)
    q_compute_words --> q_set_default: multiplication_complexity = 16
    q_set_default --> q_check_length: check max_length > 32
    q_check_length --> q_scale_up: max_length > 32
    q_check_length --> q_return: max_length <= 32
    q_scale_up --> q_return: multiplication_complexity = 2 * words**2
    q_return --> [*]: return multiplication_complexity
    note right of q_return
        INV-001: multiplication_complexity >= 16 for all inputs
        INV-002: If max_length <= 32 then multiplication_complexity == 16
        INV-003: If max_length > 32 then multiplication_complexity == 2 * ceil(max_length/8)^2
    end note
